@startuml deployment
!pragma layout smetana
title Physical deployment
node "Game PC" {
  node "KSP / Unity process" {
    artifact "KSPSerialIO.dll" as Mod
    artifact "PsimaxSerial.dll" as Serial
    component "HmiContext" as Context
    component "kRPC mod" as RPC
  }
  artifact "config.xml" as Config
}
node "Arduino UNO R4 WiFi / RA4M1" {
  artifact "KSPIODemo9 firmware" as FW
  component "12x8 matrix" as Matrix
}
node "Control panel" {
  component "SAS / RCS / screen buttons" as Buttons
  component "Status LEDs" as LEDs
}
node "Raspberry Pi / Linux" {
  component "systemd user service" as Service
  artifact "ksphmi (C++17)" as HMI
  artifact "config.toml + local overrides" as PiCfg
  component "SDL kmsdrm / fbdev fallback" as Output
}
node "Physical monitor" as Monitor
Mod ..> Serial : serial I/O library
Mod ..> Config : reads
Mod *-- Context : same assembly
Mod <--> FW : USB CDC / 115200\nframed binary packets
Buttons --> FW : pull-up GPIO
FW --> LEDs : GPIO
FW --> Matrix : matrix library
Service --> HMI : launches / restarts
HMI ..> PiCfg : reads
HMI --> RPC : TCP 50000 / 50001
HMI <--> Context : UDP 50002
HMI --> Output : frames
Output --> Monitor : scanout
note bottom of FW : Stage, CG1 and throttle pins are disabled by default.\nWi-Fi is not the application's transport.
@enduml
